      "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
      "agentRuntime": "langgraph",
      "ok": true,
      "answer": "At Prosperity 1, items **001–016** are available in the shop. You're **Eval Hero (Banner Spear)** with **25 gold**, so here's what you can and can't afford:\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Affordable (≤ 25g)\n\n**10 gold**\n| # | Name | Slot | Effect |\n|---|------|------|--------|\n| 003 | Hide Armor | Body | On the next two sources of damage from attacks targeting you, gain *Shield 1* for the attacks. *(spent)* |\n| 004 | Leather Armor | Body | When you are attacked, before drawing an attack modifier card, the attacker gains *Disadvantage*. *(spent)* |\n| 005 | Scouting Lens | Head | During your attack ability, add *Pierce 1* to one attack. *(spent)* |\n| 009 | Focusing Rod | One Hand | During your turn, if you've performed an action with *Lost*, perform *Heal 1, Range 3*. *(spent)* |\n| 011 | Healing Potion | Small Item | During your turn, perform *Heal 3, Self*. *(recoverable)* |\n| 012 | Stamina Potion | Small Item | During your turn, recover one level 1 card from your discard pile. *(lost)* |\n| 013 | Element Potion | Small Item | During your turn, *Wild*. *(recoverable)* |\n\n**15 gold**\n| # | Name | Slot | Effect |\n|---|------|------|--------|\n| 001 | Weathered Boots | Legs | During your move ability, add *Move +1*. *(spent)* |\n| 002 | Winged Shoes | Legs | During your turn, add *Jump* to all your move abilities. *(spent)* |\n| 006 | Amulet of Life | Head | During your turn, perform *Heal 1, Self*. *(spent)* |\n| 007 | Poison Dagger | One Hand | During your melee attack ability, add *Poison* to one attack. *(spent)* |\n| 008 | Heater Shield | One Hand | When you suffer damage from an attack, gain *Shield 1* for the attack. *(spent)* |\n| 010 | Simple Bow | Two Hands | During your ranged attack ability, gain *Advantage* on one attack. *(spent)* |\n\n---\n\n### ❌ Too Expensive (> 25g)\n\n| # | Name | Cost | Slot |\n|---|------|------|------|\n| 014 | Studded Leather | 20g | Body |\n| 015 | Comfortable Shoes | 20g | Legs |\n| 016 | Circlet of Elements | 20g | Head |\n\n---\n\n**Note:** Items 014–016 cost 20g each — you technically have enough gold for one of them, since 20 ≤ 25! I've listed them separately because they're the priciest tier, but all three are within reach. That said, the rulebook notes items 001–013 have no reputation requirements, while 014–016 may require faction reputation — check those cards physically to confirm before purchasing.\n\n*(Source: GHS Card Data, Gloomhaven 2nd Edition)*",
